+2026-08-25 10:00:01.000 UTC [101] LOG:  duration: 120.0 ms  statement: select * from orders where id = 7;
+2026-08-25 10:00:02.000 UTC [102] LOG:  duration: 3000.25 ms  statement: SELECT name FROM users WHERE email = 'a@b.c';
